OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussia launches largest attack on
OL,4,AUkraine energy infrastructure since
OL,5,Aspring
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe strikes also impacted people's
OL,8,Fpower supplies, with Ukraine's biggest
OL,9,Fprivate energy firm DTEK saying power
OL,10,Fto 8,000 homes had been restored
OL,11,Ffollowing "a difficult night" for the
OL,12,Fcapital.
OL,14,FThe Russian defence ministry said one
OL,15,Fof its targets was the Trypilska power
OL,16,Fstation, the largest supplier of
OL,17,Felectricity to Kyiv. The operator
OL,18,Fconfirmed damage to the plant.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
